# Optional. Defaults to the public Base Sepolia endpoint.
# The URL must answer eth_chainId with 84532. Any other chain, including
# Ethereum mainnet (1) and Base mainnet (8453), is refused.
# Cloudflare Pages: set VITE_* at build time. Vite inlines them.
# Do not put PRIVATE_KEY, RELAYER_PRIVATE_KEY, SPENCER_RUN_AUTH, LIVE_SUBMIT,
# or ADMIN_SECRET here.
# VITE_BASE_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=https://sepolia.base.org

# Optional public URL of the Base Sepolia claim relayer for `npm run dev`.
# When unset, escrow submits stay wallet-direct. When set, the relayer button
# turns on only after GET /health reports the service is up and not paused.
# The connected wallet signs an EIP-712 claim intent. This app does not send
# a shared secret.
# Production `npm run build` reads apps/wallet-ux/build-env.required.json.
# That file sets VITE_CLAIM_RELAYER_URL and VITE_BASE_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL.
# The build fails if either resolved value is empty. A non-empty shell
# value overrides the file. An empty shell value fails the build; it does not
# fall back to the file. The relayer URL must be exactly
# https://bot-verifier-claim-relayer.onrender.com,
# https://bot-verifier-claim-relayer.onrender.com/, or
# https://bot-verifier-claim-relayer.onrender.com/v1/claims.
# The build inlines that allowlist entry. An https RPC host on the allowlist
# (sepolia.base.org) is accepted. Any other public https RPC host must answer
# eth_chainId with 84532. Anything else fails the build.
# This .env file is for `npm run dev`.
# Do not put VITE_CLAIM_API_SECRET or any other secret in either file.
# Example:
# VITE_CLAIM_RELAYER_URL=https://bot-verifier-claim-relayer.onrender.com
# CORS_ORIGINS on that service must include https://agent-bv.pages.dev.
# Relayer defaults allow only that origin. https://agent-a-wallet-ux.pages.dev is refused. That Pages project has been deleted. Do not add the origin.
